  lectureTitle: Needs System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7c20f96c1e1aa145a638234856b524e, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Needs System that contains Hunger and Thirst. The Needs go
    down over time and the player needs to consume Food and Water in order to replenish
    them, otherwise the player starts losing Health.


    In this Scenario, the
    player has needs and there are items in the world for Food and Water. The player
    can also craft more complex food items that feed the player more than a basic
    item.'
